1
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:15,840
The cold wind blows and scatters your scent,
Brushing past my heart

2
00:00:15,870 --> 00:00:22,130
Like a final goodbye,
Coldly sweeping through my soul

3
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:27,800
These foolish hands that tried to hold you
Now fall helplessly to my side

4
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:32,340
Though I knew that it was over,
There were days I still could not let go

5
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:37,990
Goodbye my love my everything
I won't try to hold you anymore

6
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:42,080
It's time to let you go

7
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:47,450
Now I have to set you free,
Keeping you buried deep within my heart

8
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:52,480
This aching final farewell,
I have to let you go through tears

9
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:55,750
The last say goodbye

10
00:00:55,750 --> 00:01:01,800
I see a silhouette that looks like you
And force a smile, pretending I'm okay

11
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:07,150
In a faded photograph,
You're still smiling, bright as ever

12
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:12,770
Memories as vivid as yesterday
Leave me hurting once again today

13
00:01:12,770 --> 00:01:17,810
Every moment that we shared
Now feels like a distant, fragile dream

14
00:01:17,810 --> 00:01:23,330
Goodbye my love my everything
I won't try to hold you anymore

15
00:01:23,330 --> 00:01:27,440
It's time to let you go

16
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:32,480
Now I have to set you free,
Keeping you buried deep within my heart

17
00:01:32,760 --> 00:01:37,810
This aching final farewell,
I have to let you go through tears

18
00:01:37,810 --> 00:01:40,810
The last say goodbye

19
00:01:40,810 --> 00:01:48,740
Perhaps forgetting you
Was always an impossible thing

20
00:01:48,740 --> 00:01:55,460
But now I have to face the truth —
Our story has to end right here

21
00:01:55,460 --> 00:02:01,120
I tried to hold on
but I can't no more

22
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:06,000
Goodbye my love my everything
I won't try to hold you anymore

23
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,090
It's time to let you go

24
00:02:10,090 --> 00:02:15,440
Now I have to set you free,
Keeping you buried deep within my heart

25
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:20,750
This aching final farewell,
I have to let you go through tears

26
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:23,460
The last say goodbye

27
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:37,669
Goodbye, my love…
Please be happy

28
00:02:37,669 --> 00:02:43,818
Farewell my love
